      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INGA JOHNNY (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (23.37) at this track behind Poetic Star in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Form from his last run is proving strong. Key chance in this line up. GROOT BALE (4) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when second (25.46) at Warrnambool in a Grade 5. Can improve sharply here. NO IRON TEAM (2) has missed the frame at last two runs but could not have been more impressive the run prior in her slick 27.21 win at this track over 485m. Top win three back and rates a key player again. THORKILDSEN (5) is always hard to beat when drawn in this box.",
